    "name":  "WHITE Track Light for GU10 Lamp - THREE-PHASE",
    "reference":  "90637W",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThree-phase track spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e in \u003cb\u003ewhite\u003c/b\u003e for \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e lamps. It is made of aluminium and is very easy to install. Ideal for areas such as shop windows, supermarkets, offices, museums... \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eTrack Spotlight WHITE for GU10 Lamp - THREE-PHASE\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThree-phase track spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e made of aluminium, in \u003cstrong\u003ewhite\u003c/strong\u003e for lamps or bulbs with \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e socket.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is characterised by the fact that its \u003cstrong\u003eangle\u003c/strong\u003e of light varies according to the \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e lamp model chosen by the user.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe spotlight needs a \u003cstrong\u003eGU10\u003c/strong\u003e threaded bulb for its correct operation, you will be able to set the atmosphere of any interior space. It recreates an outstanding illumination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBulb not included.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of the WHITE Track Spotlight for GU10 Lamp - Three Phase\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupermarkets\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShopping Centres\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOffices\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eArt Galleries\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMuseums\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
